# The "Sanmaime DSL" example in README.md.
# Two condition blocks in one element; "And: Email address" in the second
# block continues "Hide:", so Email address must be hidden there.
Screen: User Details

  Element: User Information

    When: Viewing your own profile
    Show: Username
    And: Full name
    And: Email address

    When: Viewing another user's profile
    Show: Username
    Hide: Full name
    And: Email address
